
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>A1 BROADBAND 5G</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:#08111f;color:white;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}
header{padding:24px 18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#073b83,#087cf0)}
h1{font-size:25px;margin:0 0 8px}
header p{margin:0;color:#e2efff}
main{padding:18px;max-width:600px;margin:auto}
h2{font-size:19px}
.card{background:#142238;border:1px solid #2d4565;border-radius:14px;padding:16px;margin:12px 0}
.speed{font-size:23px;font-weight:bold;color:#69b5ff}
button{background:#1682ff;color:white;border:0;border-radius:9px;padding:12px;width:100%;font-size:16px}
.note{color:#bdcbe0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>A1 BROADBAND 5G</h1>
<p>Fast Internet. Endless Entertainment.</p>
</header>
<main>
<h2>Choose Your Internet Plan</h2>
<div id="plans"></div>
<div class="card">
<h2>OTT Entertainment</h2>
<p>Prime Video · JioHotstar · ZEE5 · Sony LIV</p>
<p class="note">OTT access depends on the selected pack and provider activation.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h2>IPTV Packages</h2>
<p>Star · Sony · Zee · Colors · All Marathi</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h2>Customer Support</h2>
<p>Need help with your connection?</p>
<button onclick="alert('Support ticket feature will be connected to the backend next.')">Raise Support Ticket</button>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h2>AI Assistant</h2>
<p>Get help with plans and internet support.</p>
<button onclick="alert('AI assistant requires backend integration.')">Ask AI Assistant</button>
</div>
<p class="note">Demo interface only. Online payments, customer login, live tickets and Synnefo activation are not connected yet.</p>
</main>
<script>
const speeds=[40,50,70,90,100];
document.getElementById('plans').innerHTML=speeds.map(speed=>`
<div class="card">
<div class="speed">${speed} Mbps 5G</div>
<p>Unlimited Internet Plan</p>
<button onclick="alert('Recharge and payment gateway integration is required.')">Select Plan</button>
</div>`).join('');
</script>
</body>
</html>
